e.com/gb/station/episode-552/ra.1626356225","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-552?in=soulection/sets/soulection-radio-sessions"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #552","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-552.jpg","content":"An eclectic mix of edits, R&B, house, and amapiano.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-06-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"idyKQOnL7cw","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Samon Kawamura - You are the Only One","track":{"id":"bfpR4yzP2Is","path":"/artists/samon-kawamura/tracks/you-are-the-only-one/","slug":"you-are-the-only-one","title":"You are the Only One","artist":{"slug":"samon-kawamura","title":"Samon Kawamura"},"artwork":"images/artists/samon-kawamura/tracks/you-are-the-only-one.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"lvLR-jIK1BU","slug":"145","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-145"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #145","artwork":"/images/episodes/145.jpg","content":"\nJoe selects 60 minutes of energy from Soulection HQ\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":3662,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"zlScg951Whs","position":58,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Samon Kawamura - You are the Only One","track":{"id":"bfpR4yzP2Is","path":"/artists/samon-kawamura/tracks/you-are-the-only-one/","slug":"you-are-the-only-one","title":"You are the Only One","artist":{"slug":"samon-kawamura","title":"Samon Kawamura"},"artwork":"images/artists/samon-kawamura/tracks/you-are-the-only-one.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"AfbBMadJe6c","slug":"162","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-162"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #162","artwork":"/images/episodes/162.jpg","content":"Joe reaches out to the listeners for the People Choice\n\n<!--more-->\n\nComing off Grammy week connections and our 3 Year Anniversary we returned for yet another solid show. Our special guests who were scheduled for this show couldn't make it but Joe Kay brought out a variety of new and classic gems from the Soulection crates. This show was really engaging because Joe reached out to all the listeners and asked the audience what they wanted to hear via social media. It was amazing to see how many people were listening and how many people requested for a certain track. For the last hour and 1/2 you the people we're DJ'ing/selecting music! How amazing right? Try to tune in live next time. The live feelings is always better. We'll catch you next week at the same time. Spread this if you feel it because it really is strictly about the music. Stay tuned for our 3 Year Anniversary Party announcement on Monday (1/27/14).\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"yHQ5_I5rsuc","position":22,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Samon Kawamura - You are the Only One (Joe Kay’s Slowed Edit)","track":{"id":"q2Ktl5WjKfs","path":"/artists/samon-kawamura/tracks/you-are-the-only-one-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit/","slug":"you-are-the-only-one-joe-kays-slowed-edit","title":"You are the Only One (Joe Kay’s Slowed Edit)","artist":{"slug":"samon-kawamura","title":"Samon Kawamura"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Bd4yLv8Leyg","slug":"171","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-171"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #171","artwork":"/images/episodes/171.jpg","content":"Joe Kay returned with an immense amount and plenty of new ideas/inspiration after Coachella Weekend 1. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are so many new gems in here. We also recently discovered this new platform/label out of Sydney called: [@flowfi](https://soundcloud.com/flowfi) (Accidentally spelled them out wrong on the show as F-L-O), but these guys are coming with HEAT. Make sure you pay attention to them. If you feel this whole session please share. Lets keep educating people with real music. Catch you next week at the same time.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10801,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-19T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"_Nb2l55aBjc","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Samon Kawamura - You Are The Only One","track":{"id":"bfpR4yzP2Is","path":"/artists/samon-kawamura/tracks/you-are-the-only-one/","slug":"you-are-the-only-one","title":"You are the Only One","artist":{"slug":"samon-kawamura","title":"Samon Kawamura"},"artwork":"images/artists/samon-kawamura/tracks/you-are-the-only-one.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"crc06un0Xp8","slug":"245","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-245/ra.1080836292","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-245-dilla-tribute"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #245 (Dilla Tribute)","artwork":"/images/episodes/245.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7271,"location":"US","published_at":"2016-02-06T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"DRlMh3Itstw","position":46,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Samon Kawamura - Tokyo Love","track":{"id":"d4qquisa3bY","path":"/artists/samon-kawamura/tracks/tokyo-love/","slug":"tokyo-love","title":"Tokyo Love","artist":{"slug":"samon-kawamura","title":"Samon Kawamura"},"artwork":"images/artists/samon-kawamura/tracks/tokyo-love.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id